      "side": "british",
      "name": "Two posts",
      "idea": "One squad with an LMG watches from the upper floor of the farmhouse and one with an LMG and an 8-0 from the woods at H6, eight hexes apart: between them they see the German setup area from A9 to GG10, and the Germans cannot tell which route the battalion will take.",
      "givesUp": "Each post is one squad that cannot help the other, and the farmhouse squad has no leader to rally it.",
      "terrain": [
        "From level 1, P6 sees 47 of the 83 hexes numbered 8 to 10 on board 4, from A9 to GG10; O8, P8, and Q8 are at range 2.",
        "H6 is woods and sees 32 of them, all from A9 to Q10: G8, H8, and I8 at range 2.",
        "H6 and P6 are eight hexes apart.",
